<title>USA: First Security Corp sets $150 mln snr notes.</title>
<headline>First Security Corp sets $150 mln snr notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from First Security Corp was priced on Tuesday, according to sole manager CS First Boston.</p>
<p>BORROWER FIRST SECURITY CORP</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 6.875 PCT  MATURITY 11/15/2006</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES     ISS PRICE 99.819  FIRST PAY DATE 05/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A3    YIELD 6.90 PCT    PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-PLUS  SPREAD 74 BP	CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
</text>
